{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112695","id":3004701757,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6zGBw9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112695","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112695.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112695.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112695","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112695/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112695/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112695/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/01131460b5eab3c92ae7eb0f3539d596a9e51a3a","number":112695,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add GDScript warnings for implicit bool <-> number conversions","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Implicit bool <-> number (int/float) conversions are the source of many bugs (not just in GDScript), so it's good to be able to catch them early on.\r\n\r\nYou can mark a conversion as intended using `bool()`, `int()` or `float()`.\r\n\r\nSince this is a GDScript warning like any other, you can disable it in the project settings, or turn it into an error.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/40336 by superseding it.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_bool_conversion_warnings.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23511816/test_bool_conversion_warnings.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1195\" height=\"880\" alt=\"Warnings\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c33af451-f76d-4147-aa0b-acf0c1f5f9f9\" />\r\n\r\n## TODO\r\n\r\n- [ ] Should this apply to other primitive (non-Object) types like Vector2? If so, we should figure out a way to do so while reusing as much code as possible across checks.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com